い</span> <span begin="00:08.581" end="00:09.074">痛い</span><span begin="00:09.074" end="00:09.784">くらいが</span><span begin="00:09.784" end="00:10.253">良いん</span><span begin="00:10.253" end="00:10.569">だっ</span><span begin="00:10.569" end="00:11.029">て</span><span begin="00:11.029" end="00:11.539">知っ</span><span begin="00:11.539" end="00:11.985">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">想体验羞耻的感觉</span></p><p begin="00:12.064" end="00:13.593" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4"><span begin="00:12.064" end="00:12.458">あの</span><span begin="00:12.458" end="00:12.867">夜</span><span begin="00:12.867" end="00:13.033">か</span><span begin="00:13.033" end="00:13.593">ら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">从那晚开始</span></p><p begin="00:27.957" end="00:30.837" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5"><span begin="00:27.957" end="00:28.270">こん</span><span begin="00:28.270" end="00:29.061">ばんは、</span><span begin="00:29.061" end="00:29.365">今</span><span begin="00:29.365" end="00:30.109">平気</span><span begin="00:30.109" end="00:30.837">かな？</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">晚上好 现在可以讲电话吗</span></p><p begin="00:30.864" end="00:34.253" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6"><span begin="00:30.864" end="00:31.460">特に</span><span begin="00:31.460" end="00:31.884">言い</span><span begin="00:31.884" end="00:32.197">たい</span><span begin="00:32.197" end="00:32.991">ことも</span><span begin="00:32.991" end="00:33.458">ないん</span><span begin="00:33.458" end="00:33.922">だけ</span><span begin="00:33.922" end="00:34.253">ど</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">其实也没什么特别想说的</span></p><p begin="00:34.601" end="00:36.884" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7"><span begin="00:34.601" end="00:34.801">も</span><span begin="00:34.801" end="00:35.049">う</span><span begin="00:35.049" end="00:35.471">あれや</span><span begin="00:35.471" end="00:36.007">これや</span><span begin="00:36.007" end="00:36.426">浮かぶ</span> <span begin="00:36.426" end="00:36.633">"いい</span><span begin="00:36.633" end="00:36.884">な"</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">各种记忆浮现脑海 真好</span></p><p begin="00:36.887" end="00:38.717" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8"><span begin="00:36.887" end="00:37.267">君が</span><span begin="00:37.267" end="00:37.663">居なくちゃ</span><span begin="00:37.663" end="00:38.136">どれでも</span><span begin="00:38.136" end="00:38.341">ない</span><span begin="00:38.341" end="00:38.717">や</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">可你要是不在 便都没有意义</span></p><p begin="00:38.926" end="00:42.044" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9"><span begin="00:38.926" end="00:40.175">仮面同士</span><span begin="00:40.175" end="00:40.400">で</span><span begin="00:40.400" end="00:40.997">イチャ</span><span begin="00:41.059" end="00:41.616">つい</span><span begin="00:41.616" end="00:41.716">て</span><span begin="00:41.716" end="00:42.044">ら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">戴着面具的两人正在亲热</span></p><p begin="00:42.165" end="00:44.993" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10"><span begin="00:42.165" end="00:43.084">寸寸</span> <span begin="00:43.084" end="00:43.828">恋と</span><span begin="00:43.828" end="00:44.501">表記</span><span begin="00:44.501" end="00:44.993">せず</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">肝肠寸断 不能标记为恋爱</span></p><p begin="00:45.142" end="00:48.645" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11"><span begin="00:45.142" end="00:45.793">気持ち</span> <span begin="00:45.793" end="00:46.238">vs</span> <span begin="00:46.238" end="00:47.383">退屈は</span><span begin="00:47.383" end="00:48.079">PK</span><span begin="00:48.079" end="00:48.645">戦</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">死心塌地与无聊厌倦是场PK战</span></p><p begin="00:48.916" end="00:51.224" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12"><span begin="00:48.916" end="00:49.398">そう</span><span begin="00:49.398" end="00:49.826">なにも</span><span begin="00:49.826" end="00:50.306">かもに</span><span begin="00:50.306" end="00:50.970">迷子が</span><span begin="00:50.970" end="00:51.224">おり</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">面对一切都感到迷茫无措</span></p><p begin="00:51.234" end="00:53.007" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13"><span begin="00:51.234" end="00:51.570">泪</span><span begin="00:51.570" end="00:52.090">流して</span><span begin="00:52.090" end="00:52.652">SOS</span><span begin="00:52.652" end="00:53.007">を</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">流下眼泪 发出SOS</span></p><p begin="00:53.272" end="00:54.852" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14"><span begin="00:53.272" end="00:53.870">半目</span><span begin="00:53.870" end="00:54.440">開き</span><span begin="00:54.440" end="00:54.852">で</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">半睁着眼睛 喵喵</span></p><p begin="00:55.009" end="00:56.545" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15"><span begin="00:55.009" end="00:55.255">娘</span><span begin="00:55.255" end="00:55.727">娘</span><span begin="00:55.727" end="00:56.545">する</span></p><p begin="00:56.958" end="00:58.528" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16"><span begin="00:56.958" end="00:57.843">病事も</span><span begin="00:57.843" end="00:58.528">全部</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">生病的事也全部</span></p><p begin="00:58.808" end="01:00.364" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17"><span begin="00:58.808" end="00:59.243">君の</span><span begin="00:59.243" end="00:59.701">もとへ</span><span begin="00:59.701" end="01:00.364">添付</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">写信告诉你</span></p><p begin="01:00.622" end="01:03.240" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18"><span begin="01:00.622" end="01:00.970">ツライ</span><span begin="01:00.970" end="01:01.289">こと</span><span begin="01:01.289" end="01:01.712">ほど</span><span begin="01:01.712" end="01:01.957">分け</span><span begin="01:01.957" end="01:02.406">合い</span><span begin="01:02.406" end="01:02.624">たい</span><span begin="01:02.624" end="01:03.240">じゃない</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">虽然并非像痛苦一样</span></p><p begin="01:03.533" end="01:07.418" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19"><span begin="01:03.533" end="01:03.826">この</span><span begin="01:03.826" end="01:04.263">好き</span><span begin="01:04.263" end="01:04.689">から</span><span begin="01:04.689" end="01:05.113">逃げ</span><span begin="01:05.113" end="01:05.582">たい</span><span begin="01:05.582" end="01:07.418">な</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">好想逃离这份喜欢</span></p><p begin="01:07.528" end="01:08.441" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20"><span begin="01:07.528" end="01:07.703">やっ</span><span begin="01:07.703" end="01:08.441">ぱ-ぱ-ぱ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">果然还是</span></p><p begin="01:08.498" end="01:11.480" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21"><span begin="01:08.498" end="01:09.129">乙女</span><span begin="01:09.129" end="01:10.067">解剖</span><span begin="01:10.067" end="01:10.284">で</span><span begin="01:10.284" end="01:10.631">あそ</span><span begin="01:10.631" end="01:11.093">ぼう</span><span begin="01:11.093" end="01:11.480">よ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">来玩少女解剖吧</span></p><p begin="01:11.542" end="01:15.140" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22"><span begin="01:11.542" end="01:12.432">本当の</span><span begin="01:12.432" end="01:13.377">名前で</span><span begin="01:13.377" end="01:13.828">ほら</span><span begin="01:13.828" end="01:14.190">呼び</span><span begin="01:14.190" end="01:14.677">合</span><span begin="01:14.677" end="01:15.140">って</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我们用真名呼唤彼此</span></p><p begin="01:15.234" end="01:19.148" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23"><span begin="01:15.234" end="01:15.551">「いき</span><span begin="01:15.551" end="01:16.023">たく</span><span begin="01:16.023" end="01:16.547">ない」</span><span begin="01:16.547" end="01:17.126">そう</span><span begin="01:17.126" end="01:17.857">言えば</span><span begin="01:17.857" end="01:18.204">いいん</span><span begin="01:18.204" end="01:18.715">だっ</span><span begin="01:18.715" end="01:19.148">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不想再活下去了</span></p><p begin="01:19.347" end="01:22.361" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24"><span begin="01:19.347" end="01:20.249">楽に</span><span begin="01:20.249" end="01:21.015">なれる</span><span begin="01:21.015" end="01:21.189">か</span><span begin="01:21.189" end="01:22.361">な</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">是否就能解脱了呢</span></p><p begin="01:22.805" end="01:25.787" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25"><span begin="01:22.805" end="01:23.436">乙女</span><span begin="01:23.436" end="01:24.374">解剖</span><span begin="01:24.374" end="01:24.591">で</span><span begin="01:24.591" end="01:24.938">あそ</span><span begin="01:24.938" end="01:25.400">ぼう</span><span begin="01:25.400" end="01:25.787">よ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">来玩少女解剖吧</span></p><p begin="01:25.938" end="01:29.401" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26"><span begin="01:25.938" end="01:26.765">ドキドキ</span><span begin="01:26.765" end="01:27.293">した</span><span begin="01:27.293" end="01:27.463">い</span><span begin="01:27.463" end="01:27.940">じゃん</span><span begin="01:27.940" end="01:28.145">か</span><span begin="01:28.145" end="01:28.486">誰</span><span begin="01:28.486" end="01:28.902">だっ</span><span begin="01:28.902" end="01:29.401">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不论谁都会想感受心跳加速吧</span></p><p begin="01:29.539" end="01:34.400" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27"><span begin="01:29.539" end="01:30.140">恥を</span><span begin="01:30.140" end="01:30.823">した</span><span begin="01:30.823" end="01:30.996">い</span> <span begin="01:30.996" end="01:31.489">痛い</span><span begin="01:31.489" end="01:32.199">くらいが</span><span begin="01:32.199" end="01:32.668">良いん</span><span begin="01:32.668" end="01:32.984">だっ</span><span begin="01:32.984" end="01:33.444">て</span><span begin="01:33.444" end="01:33.954">知っ</span><span begin="01:33.954" end="01:34.400">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">想体验羞耻的感觉</span></p><p begin="01:34.497" end="01:36.026" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28"><span begin="01:34.497" end="01:34.891">あの</span><span begin="01:34.891" end="01:35.300">夜</span><span begin="01:35.300" end="01:35.466">か</span><span begin="01:35.466" end="01:36.026">ら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">从那晚开始</span></p><p begin="01:50.273" end="01:53.166" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29"><span begin="01:50.273" end="01:51.021">こんな</span><span begin="01:51.021" end="01:51.790">早くに</span><span begin="01:51.790" end="01:52.283">ご</span><span begin="01:52.283" end="01:52.460">めん</span><span begin="01:52.460" end="01:53.166">ね？</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这么早把你吵醒</span></p><p begin="01:53.217" end="01:55.057" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30"><span begin="01:53.217" end="01:53.816">起こし</span><span begin="01:53.816" end="01:54.497">ちゃった</span><span begin="01:54.497" end="01:55.057">よね</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">真对不起</span></p><p begin="01:55.067" end="01:56.698" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31"><span begin="01:55.067" end="01:55.506">今</span><span begin="01:55.506" end="01:56.698">大丈夫？</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">现在可以讲电话吗</span></p><p begin="01:57.471" end="02:01.222" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L32"><span begin="01:57.471" end="01:57.822">君が</span><span begin="01:57.822" end="01:58.338">別の</span><span begin="01:58.338" end="01:58.762">人の</span><span begin="01:58.762" end="01:59.237">ことを</span><span begin="01:59.237" end="01:59.667">好きに</span><span begin="01:59.667" end="02:00.125">なるって</span><span begin="02:00.125" end="02:00.454">夢を</span><span begin="02:00.454" end="02:00.847">見たん</span><span begin="02:00.847" end="02:01.222">だ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我做了一个梦</span></p><p begin="02:01.228" end="02:02.964" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L33"><span begin="02:01.228" end="02:02.345">否定して</span><span begin="02:02.345" end="02:02.964">ほしい</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">希望你可以否认 呐 爱我吧</span></p><p begin="02:03.042" end="02:04.504" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key